    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Auctioneers are delighted to offer this well presented and ideally located 3 bedroom, 3 bath semi-detached property to the market in the popular Whitethorn Development, Palmerstown. Located within a quaint Cul de sac in this highly sought after development and opposite a large green area, this home is accessible to all local amenities including schools, shops, M50/N4 and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre. Internal living accommodation of c. 80 Sq m consists of; Entrance hall, WC, Lounge and open plan kitchen/dining room to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three bedrooms with ensuite to master and a family bathroom. Externally to the rear you benefit from a fully enclosed EAST facing garden with side access to the front which offers a drive way for off road parking. Number 178 comes to the market in great condition throughout and further benefits from double glazing throughout, gas central heating and a long list of upgrades and improvements. Based on type of property and location we see this being extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and book a viewing.\n\nFeatures\nBer D\nc.80 Sqm\nWell presented throughout\nDriveway to front\nCul de sac location\nLarge green to front\nEnsuite to master\nClose to amenities\nDouble glazing\nBuilt in appliances\nSituated in a cul de sac\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\nMature and sought after development\n\nDirections\nD22 K4K8"
      },
      {
